msgid ""
"This will update all the author profiles in PublishPress Authors to match "
"the default WordPress fields for each user."
msgstr ""
"Dette vil opdatere alle forfatterprofiler i PublishPress forfattere for at "
"matche de standard WordPress-felter for hver bruger."

